      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with this one.\n\nI've ran into a lot of worlds that leave so little info about the world itself that you are never sure if it's going to contain horror or jumpscares at all.\n\nSome of them just tread on this \"psychological horror\" area, but with some worlds never giving information or even mentioning this - it leaves this weird blurry area for others to feel anxious because of uncertainty.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
